{"id":"4022169792036012241","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"紀錄一下最近發生的一件荒謬事🤣\n\n一張價值 $4,700 的演唱會門票，\n就這樣被啃得面目全非……🙂\n\n原本想說 QR Code 還在，\n應該還是可以正常入場吧？\n\n但越想越不放心，\n所以還是打電話去問了 KKTIX。\n\n結果沒想到……\n竟然需要先去警察局報案，\n拿到報案三聯單才能後續處理？？？🤣\n\n於是就這樣……\n人生第一次因為演唱會門票被咬爛，\n跑去警察局報案。\n只好把其中一名嫌疑犯一起帶去了🙂\n\n說！！！到底是你們之中誰做的～～～🐹🐹🐹🐹\n\n一個個都給我裝無辜是不是！！😭😭😭","username":"meoutoto1210","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@meoutoto1210/post/DfRnh2QnQDR","timestamp":"2026-11-03T10:00:25Z","media_type":"CAROUSEL_ALBUM","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-11-03T17:18:33.682900278Z","first_seen_at":"2026-11-03T17:18:57.095776Z","last_seen_at":"2026-11-03T17:18:57.095776Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_94b99b874254b7ad","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":false,"clean_exclusion_reason":"ticket_resale"}
