{"id":"4022258725003226160","query":"concert","source_queries":["concert"],"text":"Random thought, but how cool would it be if the members released solo albums and went on a tour together but have some set timings to perform individually! They can probably perform like 3 songs each, and then perform as a group for like 3-4 songs.\n\nLike imagine seeing SNTY, SGMB, Amygdala, Running Wild, Killin’ It Girl, Wild Flower and Love Me Again at one sitting! 😱😱😱\n\nThat sounds like a really fun concert to be in, but in all honesty, would only be possible if BTS is under Yana Hit (aka me).","username":"athinlyslicedhope","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@athinlyslicedhope/post/DfR7v_iiGww","timestamp":"2026-11-03T12:57:06Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["concert"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-11-03T17:18:50.982459846Z","first_seen_at":"2026-11-03T17:18:57.095776Z","last_seen_at":"2026-11-03T17:18:57.095776Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_03187487517c9034","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
{"id":"4022264077464351202","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"氣到現在還在氣 \n追了兩年多 從我剛入坑 \n在台灣糊糊的根本沒什麼人在討論 \n所謂的小眾男團 到現在隨便一間店\n都可以聽到ATEEZ的音樂  一首歌真的飛升了\n2年時間 參加過20幾場你們的活動\n說實話 也陪伴你們很久了吧\n\n第一次刷票 \n迫不及待的飛海外看看TTL 安可 \n很美好很美好 很幸福的回憶\n即使後續的十幾場演唱會 位置越來越近\n你們越來越清楚 甚至一堆飯撒鏡頭 \n我辦公室桌布 永遠是TTL安可場 \n看台位置拍的那張宋旼琦 人物小小的 \n只看的到大屏上的宋先生 真的太幸福了\n永遠無法忘記 花車時候 整個人幸福到爆哭出來的感動 \n同時我旁邊的中國男飯 也一直哽咽落淚 \n再然後 後面一群海外粉激動的喊著成員的名字\n散場時 五顏六色 洋人 日本人 一堆中文使用者  人生第一場海外場 印象非常深刻 原來你們的海外粉絲這麼多呀\n整場TTL安可 我真的只遇到一個韓飯在發應援 \n清一色歐美國家粉絲 俄羅斯漂亮到像模特的粉絲 接下班時一堆歐美站姐扛著大砲在拍攝 排場週時前後左右都是台灣人\n請問 KQ你們要的純血韓國人粉絲在哪裡呢？\nATEEZ你們是是全世界最不配搞韓國人優先購的團。","username":"yuzzz______","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@yuzzz______/post/DfR894aE7Hi","timestamp":"2026-11-03T13:07:44Z","media_type":"IMAGE","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-11-03T17:18:33.68299733Z","first_seen_at":"2026-11-03T17:18:57.095776Z","last_seen_at":"2026-11-03T17:18:57.095776Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_87d8a4b5671ad701","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
